 ],
 "note": "คีย์ชนิดข้อมูลถูกตัดออกแล้วโดย mark_dnt.py",
 "strings": {
  "One of our own gets killed at home...": "",
  "And the chief deputy's rep's in the gutter.": "",
  "Heheh, Shinsengumi's gonna be takin' some real interesting turns from here on out.": "",
  "First Inoue, now Yamazaki.": "",
  "Is that damned Ryoma involved somehow?": "",
  "You know, the guy we couldn't catch because all you losers got too nosy.": "",
  "Ito-han's still pretty pissed about the Teradaya incident.": "",
  "Once he's chief...": "",
  "Oh, man, I can't wait to see what he does to ya!": "",
  "Hajime-san, be careful if you're gonna be out wandering around.": "",
  "Hajime-san, I hope you don't hold anything against Oryo-chan.": "",
  "That girl really does put you first, Hajime-san.": "",
  "I know it's best I keep to myself, though.": "",
  "So I take ya heard about Yamazaki, then?": "",
  "You should head to the warehouse.": "",
  "The body'll still be there.": "",
  "Can't believe we've lost so many people so fast.": "",
  "Feels like we're surrounded by an invisible enemy or somethin'.": "",
  "You've heard Heisuke's take, right?": "",
  "How whoever killed Yamazaki musta been in the Shinsengumi?": "",
  "Better get answers soon, or we'll have deserters on our hands, and lots of 'em.": "",
  "Heh, it's just as you say.": "",
  "I think I'm starting to understand why the chief likes you so much...": "",
  "That'll be fine for now.": "",
  "So we're bustin' in on Edo Castle...": "",
  "Y'know, there's no tellin' if we'll come back from this.": "",
  "Gets me excited just thinkin' about it.": "",
  "Anyway, where should we go after this?": "",
  "Might get found out if we grab a drink with Toshi-chan or Shinpa-chan.": "",
  "But it ain't fun by yourself either.": "",
  "Dammit, this sucks...": "",
  "Better go say hi to that Okami.": "",
  "Today could be your last, y'know.": "",
  "Lookin' forward to stormin' the castle, Hajime-chan?": "",
  "'Course you are.": "",
  "Not every day ya get to turn over a palace.": "",
  "Just try not to hog all the fun for yourself!": "",
  "We'll give that Sakamoto Ryoma a real kick in the ass.": "",
  "Infiltratin' Edo Castle's the last thing they'd expect.": "",
  "What a nightmare...": "",
  "They're sayin' the Shinsengumi did this?": "",
  "If there was at least a trooper around, we could ask what the hell happened...": "",
  "But, still, to say the Shinsengumi's to blame? That's just stupid.": "",
  "We gotta hurry up and find Isami-chan.": "",
  "Ah well, no point in overthinkin' it.": "",
  "Let's hurry over to Isami-chan.": "",
  "I'm sure he's over at that ryotei.": "",
  "No troopers in sight.": "",
  "They must be burnin' through this place pretty quick.": "",
  "That ain't the way!": "",
  "No time for detours, eh?": "",
  "We need to get to Isami-chan.": "",
  "Not that way!": "",
  "Where you goin'?": "",
  "We gotta hurry to the ryotei!": "",
  "Hey, you tryin' to get yourself killed?": "",
  "Don't leave me behind! Might start gettin' lonely.": "",
  "Guess it's time to stand your ground, Hajime-san.": "",
  "Both Oryo-chan and I'll do whatever we can to help, just say the word.": "",
  "Don't worry one bit about Omiya.": "",
  "Best thing is to see this mess resolved and bring peace back to Kyo.": "",
  "Just remember you still owe me all of that rent, so be ready to pay up when the time comes.": "",
  "So, Hajime-san, you looked up to Sakamoto Ryoma like an older brother, is that right?": "",
  "I suppose life is strange that way sometimes.": "",
  "But since you're the real Sakamoto Ryoma, should I maybe call you Ryoma-san instead?": "",
  "Oh, forget it!": "",
  "At this point, it'd be too hard to change.": "",
  "Saito, what're you doin' comin' here?": "",
  "Wouldn't it be better to lay low for a bit?": "",
  "Can't make any progress 'less we lure out your imposter...": "",
  "All we can do is pray Heisuke will work somethin' out.": "",
  "I'm sure he'll pull this thing off.": "",
  "Call it a feelin'.": "",
  "That okami at Teradaya deserves": "",
  "her reputation as a good soul,": "",
  "the way she handed over that Omiya building.": "",
  "You're a blessed guy, Saito. With good people around you.": "",
  "\"A feast for the crows,\" hm?": "",
  "I'm sure it looks that way to most...": "",
  "Still, no matter the stigma, we'll be sure to save this country.": "",
  "That's the role of the Shinsengumi, our promise to Kondo-san.": "",
  "Saito-kun.": "",
  "There's not much I can do on my end.": "",
  "Our hopes lie with Nakaoka and Heisuke.": "",
  "I'll be here awaiting the news.": "",
  "I'll notify you if there's any movement.": "",
  "Omiya, eh... Pretty gutsy of that okami for lettin' us rampage like that, eh?": "",
  "I like her style.": "",
  "Can't believe I got to raid Edo Castle! Hehe!": "",
  "Never a dull moment with ya, Hajime-chan!": "",
  "I don't know how much help I can be, but...": "",
  "If there's anything I can do to help, I'll do it.": "",
  "It's the least I can do for you...": "",
  "This must've been so hard for Okami-san...": "",
  "Offering up the Omiya, knowing it might get destroyed...": "",
  "Hajime-san, please, do what you can to help the city.": "",
  "Where are you headed, Hajime-san?": "",
  "I'm good with anywhere, y'know?": "",
  "This is the first stroll I've taken through town just to enjoy it.": "",
  "So, I'm okay with going wherever you usually go.": "",
  "I'm just happy to spend the time with you.": "",
  "Walking around like this together...": "",
  "It sort of feels like I'm seeing the city for the first time again.": "",
  "I haven't had fun like this since moving to Kyo...": "",
  "I hope we'll be able to do this all the time someday soon.": "",
  "Thanks for taking me out, Hajime-san.": "",
  "Know any good restaurants?": "",
  "Could we stop to eat somewhere around here?": "",
  "I'm okay with anything you like.": "",
  "The Shinsengumi barracks are up ahead, right?": "",
  "I wonder if those captains are around...": "",
  "You know there's a tea parlor around here, right?": "",
  "Their dango is fantastic.": "",
  "Do you come here a lot, Hajime-san?": "",
  "Is this a bathhouse?": "",
  "I don't think we can go in there together...": "",
  "Somewhere around here...": "",
  "There's a general store called Don Quijote, I think.": "",
  "They sell all kinds of stuff there.": "",
  "Why don't we check it out?": "",
  "Have you heard about the singing bar?": "",
  "You get to sing along with the songs they play.": "",
  "It sounds like a lot of fun...": "",
  "And I'd love to hear your singing voice, Hajime-san.": "",
  "Hey, why don't we stop by there?": "",
  "Isn't Mukurogai that way?": "",
  "Isn't it... dangerous there?": "",
  "I don't mind going there...": "",
  "Just so long as you stay close by me, Hajime-san.": "",
  "Are you sure... we're in the right place?": "",
  "I mean, if this is where you wanted to come...": "",
  "It's just, if I wasn't here with you, Hajime-san...": "",
  "I don't think I would've come here.": "",
  "Say, Hajime-san, do you remember what happened here?": "",
  "When you came to find me after I ran off...": "",
  "You chased after me all the way from Teradaya.": "",
  "That's when I realized you couldn't be such a bad person...": "",
  "When I look at the river from here, it makes me remember...": "",
  "That's why I like to come here on my breaks.": "",
  "In fact, I'd say it's my favorite spot in the whole city.": "",
  "Hey, wait!": "",
  "Don't leave me behind...": "",
  "You're too fast, Hajime-san!": "",
  "Please, wait... I almost lost you.": "",
  "You really do like running, huh?": "",
  "Why don't we stop for a break somewhere?": "",
  "Saigo-san and Katsura-san seem really nice.": "",
  "They took good care of you when you were... you know.": "",
  "Those Shinsengumi captains look intimidating...": "",
  "but after you talk to them, you realize they're not really that scary.": "",
  "I guess you're the same way, Hajime-san.": "",
  "Before I actually talked to you, you seemed really mean.": "",
  "Sakamoto-san...": "",
  "Tomorrow's the big day.": "",
  "There's no telling what Takechi-san's setting up for you.": "",
  "My advice? Never let your guard down.": "",
  "At some point, every man's gotta face down some impossible odds.": "",
  "I'm thinkin' tomorrow's yer day fer that.": "",
  "You whup their asses, Sakamoto.": "",
  "Oh, Sakamoto-san! Over here.": "",
  "Ah, Oryo-chan, too. How are you?": "",
  "Well, isn't this nice, the two of you out together?": "",
  "C'mon, man! Don't pester 'em on their date.": "",
  "Oh. Right.": "",
  "Sorry about that.": "",
  "It's all right.": "",
  "We don't mind at all.": "",
  "Hey, Oryo-chan?": "",
  "You keep an eye out for Sakamoto-san, all right?": "",
  "He's got a penchant for getting himself in trouble.": "",
  "Heheh, don't I know it!": "",
  "Sounds like we've all got ya pegged, Sakamoto-han.": "",
  "Saito, you don't have much time til we head for Tosa.": "",
  "Make sure you don't leave here with any regrets.": "",
  "Oh, it's you, Saito.": "",
  "Hmph. Looks like ya got yerself some company.": "",
  "Guess ya got <i>some</i> charm after all...": "",
  "What's yer deal, Hajime-chan?": "",
  "Ya got this nice gal at yer side an' <i>this</i> is where ya take her?": "",
  "Right, Oryo-chan?": "",
  "My exact thought.": "",
  "Why don't you two go somewhere with a lighter atmosphere?": "",
  "I'm sure she'd find it preferable.": "",
  "Heh, they sure told ya.": "",
  "I'm just thinking about how this may be the last time I look out on this city.": "",
  "We depart tomorrow.": "",
  "Make sure you take care of all your affairs.": "",
  "Hajime-chan!": "",
  "What're ya doin' here?": "",
  "It's the last time yer gonna be in town, right?": "",
  "And that time's better spent with Oryo-chan than me, right?": "",
  "So, move yer ass already.": "",
  "Aw, well don't you two look so sweet together?": "",
  "You better take good care of her, Hajime-san.": "",
  "There are still plenty of dangerous types around here to look out for.": "",
  "I'm sorry, Okami-san.": "",
  "I'll be back as soon as I can...": "",
  "Don't you worry.": "",
  "I can handle running things here, no problem.": "",
  "In fact, I want you spending the evening with Hajime-san.": "",
  "We don't have many other customers, anyhow.": "",
  "So go, go! Have yourselves a good time.": "",
  "Saito-san, why do you look so upset?": "",
  "With a beautiful girl at your side like that, you should seem happier.": "",
  "Oh, it's all right, ma'am.": "",
  "Hajime-san can't help the way he looks.": "",
  "I suppose that's true.": "",
  "Well, off you go.": "",
  "Oryo-chan.": "",
  "You enjoy your time off now, okay?": "",
  "What're you back here for?": "",
  "You should be out, taking in as much of the city as you still can.": "",
  "Something wrong?": "",
  "You're hurt!": "",
  "You need to get some rest.": "",
  "Are you drunk?": "",
  "Don't drink too much, all right?": "",
  "You seem awfully busy...": "",
  "Are you sure you're okay on your feet?": "",
  "Oww...": "",
  "Are you okay?": "",
  "Oh, are you all right?": "",
  "Please come see me anytime.": "",
  "Right, see you later.": "",
  "Ah, it's you.": "",
  "Oh, what's wrong?": "",
  "Something the matter?": "",
  "Hm...": "",
  "Oh, it's you.": "",
  "Looks like you're hurt...": "",
  "Want me to take a look?": "",
  "I'm guessing you're drunk?": "",
  "Why don't we hit the town together later?": "",
  "Oh, in a hurry?": "",
  "Be more careful.": "",
  "It's dangerous to be rushing like that.": "",
  "Don't push yourself too hard.": "",
  "Sakamoto.": "",
  "Hey, what is it?": "",
  "You need something?": "",
  "Ah, Sakamoto.": "",
  "Hey, you're hurt.": "",
  "Our rep can't be gettin' knocked about like that.": "",
  "Drunk, are you?": "",
  "Nice day for a drink, innit?": "",
  "What... you in a rush?": "",
  "Hey, what're you doin'!?": "",
  "Watch yourself, there.": "",
  "What're you doing?": "",
  "Watch iiit!": ""
 }
}